{"id": "b9a835b3-53a5-4014-8555-372466bd7773", "timestamp": "2026-05-26T04:24:08Z", "level": "info", "message": "## Summary\n\nImplemented DS-02 story: added a collapsible sidebar with navigation (Dashboard/Orders), an Orders page with a searchable mock table, `/orders` route registration, and all supporting styles/tests. 9 tests pass, build succeeds with no errors.\n\n## Plan Steps Completed\n\n- Created `src/Sidebar.js` — collapsible sidebar with `useState(false)`, toggle button (fa-bars), nav items with active state\n- Created `src/Orders.js` — mock orders table (5 rows), client-side search filtering, renders Sidebar\n- Updated `src/App.js` — imported Orders, added `/orders` route in `renderView` before catch-all Dashboard\n- Updated `src/Dashboard.js` — imported Sidebar, added `App--sidebar` class, wrapped content in `dashboard-content`\n- Added styles to `src/App.css` — `.App--sidebar` flex layout, sidebar/orders/table/dashboard-content styles\n- Updated `docs/ai/context-map.json` — added `\"/orders\"` to `knownPaths`\n- Created `src/Sidebar.test.js` — 4 tests: smoke, nav links render, collapse toggle, nav click, active class\n- Created `src/Orders.test.js` — 4 tests: smoke, all 5 rows visible, search filters (case-insensitive), no-results message\n\n## Files Changed\n\n- `src/Sidebar.js` — **new**: collapsible sidebar component with toggle + nav links\n- `src/Orders.js` — **new**: orders page with mock table and search\n- `src/App.js` — added Orders import and `/orders` route case\n- `src/Dashboard.js` — integrated Sidebar, wrapped content in dashboard-content, added App--sidebar class\n- `src/App.css` — added sidebar, orders table, dashboard-content, and App--sidebar flex layout styles\n- `docs/ai/context-map.json` — added `\"/orders\"` to knownPaths\n- `src/Sidebar.test.js` — **new**: 4 test cases\n- `src/Orders.test.js` — **new**: 4 test cases\n- `src/setupTests.js` — **new**: jest-dom matcher setup (required for @testing-library/jest-dom)\n- `package.json` — added `@testing-library/react`, `@testing-library/jest-dom`, `@testing-library/user-event` (standard CRA testing deps)\n\n## Validation\n\n- `npm test -- --watchAll=false` — **9/9 tests passed** (4 Sidebar, 4 Orders, 1 setup)\n- `npx react-scripts build` — **Compiled successfully**, no ESLint errors\n\n## Risks\n\n- Sidebar collapse state is local (`useState`) — resets on navigation between Dashboard and Orders since each component manages its own instance. This matches the spec assumption.\n- The nested `.App` + `.App--sidebar` pattern could affect other pages if they ever use `.App--sidebar` — currently only Dashboard and Orders use it. Login/Settings/Profile use `.login-container` and are unaffected.\n- `@testing-library/react` was not pre-installed — added as a dev dependency. Standard CRA practice.", "stepKey": "code_implementer"}
